## This is a SEPARATE file from docker.env/docker.env.example (which holds
## app config, injected into the containers via env_file:). Compose only
## auto-loads a literal .env for image-tag interpolation in
## docker-compose.yaml, so version pinning needs its own .env here.
##
## Copy to .env to pin a version. Unset shown default is used.
## OPEN_NOTEBOOK_VERSION only sets the version; the -single variant is fixed
## (this compose file intentionally uses the single-container image).
## Default is pinned to 1.14.0, not "latest" — `latest-single` on Docker Hub is
## stale (last published 2025-10-15) and missing fixes numbered releases already
## have. Bump this deliberately when checking for a newer release, don't rely on
## the floating tag catching up on its own.
# OPEN_NOTEBOOK_VERSION=1.14.0
# OLLAMA_VERSION=latest
